      "html": "<div class=\"s-text\"><div class=\"s-stage\">Практическая часть</div><div class=\"s-num\">Шаг 2</div><span class=\"stars\" title=\"уровень 1\">★</span><h2>Прямоугольник, чёрный: длинный кузов</h2><p class=\"s-hint\">Тянем наискосок, потом щёлк мимо</p></div><div class=\"s-fig\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 1190 725\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"fig-svg shot\"><image x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1190\" height=\"725\" href=\"/content/1-klass-2-chetvert/media/6070b7211d69d5f6.webp\"></image><rect x=\"496\" y=\"67\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#ff6a00\" stroke-width=\"5.5\" class=\"hl\"></rect><circle cx=\"508.0\" cy=\"51\" r=\"16\" fill=\"#ff6a00\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"></circle><text x=\"508.0\" y=\"57.5\" font-size=\"19\" font-weight=\"800\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">1</text><rect x=\"746\" y=\"67\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#ff6a00\" stroke-width=\"5.5\" class=\"hl\"></rect><circle cx=\"758.0\" cy=\"51\" r=\"16\" fill=\"#ff6a00\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"></circle><text x=\"758.0\" y=\"57.5\" font-size=\"19\" font-weight=\"800\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">2</text></svg></div>"
