      "kind": "step",
      "stage": "practice",
      "step": 8,
      "level": 1,
      "html": "<div class=\"s-text\"><div class=\"s-stage\">Практическая часть</div><div class=\"s-num\">Шаг 8</div><span class=\"stars\" title=\"уровень 1\">★</span><h2>Толстая линия через весь лист — и залей землю</h2><p class=\"s-hint\">Линия должна касаться обоих краёв листа</p></div><div class=\"s-fig\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 1190 725\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"fig-svg shot\"><image x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1190\" height=\"725\" href=\"/content/1-klass-2-chetvert/media/6f7af22c0b00da9a.webp\"></image><rect x=\"282\" y=\"70\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#ff6a00\" stroke-width=\"5.5\" class=\"hl\"></rect><circle cx=\"308\" cy=\"68\" r=\"16\" fill=\"#ff6a00\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"></circle><text x=\"308\" y=\"74.5\" font-size=\"19\" font-weight=\"800\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">1</text><rect x=\"883\" y=\"67\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#ff6a00\" stroke-width=\"5.5\" class=\"hl\"></rect><circle cx=\"895.0\" cy=\"51\" r=\"16\" fill=\"#ff6a00\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"></circle><text x=\"895.0\" y=\"57.5\" font-size=\"19\" font-weight=\"800\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">2</text></svg></div>"
