      "kind": "step",
      "stage": "practice",
      "step": 12,
      "level": 1,
      "html": "<div class=\"s-text\"><div class=\"s-stage\">Практическая часть</div><div class=\"s-num\">Шаг 12</div><span class=\"stars\" title=\"уровень 1\">★</span><h2>«Отменить», найди дырку, закрой кистью</h2><p class=\"s-hint\">Дырка там, где круг не сомкнулся</p></div><div class=\"s-fig\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 1190 725\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"fig-svg shot\"><image x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1190\" height=\"725\" href=\"/content/1-klass-2-chetvert/media/91db386bdd1b509e.webp\"></image><rect x=\"288\" y=\"27\" width=\"30\" height=\"28\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#ff6a00\" stroke-width=\"5.5\" class=\"hl\"></rect><circle cx=\"316\" cy=\"25\" r=\"16\" fill=\"#ff6a00\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"></circle><text x=\"316\" y=\"31.5\" font-size=\"19\" font-weight=\"800\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">1</text><rect x=\"369\" y=\"74\" width=\"46\" height=\"58\" rx=\"9\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#ff6a00\" stroke-width=\"5.5\" class=\"hl\"></rect><circle cx=\"413\" cy=\"72\" r=\"16\" fill=\"#ff6a00\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"></circle><text x=\"413\" y=\"78.5\" font-size=\"19\" font-weight=\"800\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">2</text></svg></div>"
